Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:08.50,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(636.879,341.299)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,5300,6260)}Episode 16
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:08.50,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632.195,556.363)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,5300,6260)}Guan Yu's Three Terms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:06.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Fēi captured Cáo Cāo's General, Liú Dài, at their camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:09.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, Liú Bèi feared Cáo Cāo would return,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:12.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,so he released Liú Dài and Wáng Zhōng back to Xǔchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:17.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, he ordered Guān Yǔ to protect his wives and to remain at Xiàpī.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:21.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sūn Qián and the others guarded Xú Province\Nwhile Zhāng Fēi guarded Xiǎopèi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:26.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,They thus formed an ox-horn defense against Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.273,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2300,2420)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dǒng Chéng's servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is Qín Qìngtóng.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Dǒng Chéng's concubine and I were talking in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dǒng Chéng saw us, suspected us of an affair, and had me beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:06.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2540,2860)\pos(303.727,566.182)}Qín Qìngtóng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I ran away from the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Wáng Zǐfú, Wú Zǐlán, Zhǒng Jí, Wú Shuò, and Mǎ Téng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,had a secret meeting in the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.34,0:01:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They plan to murder you, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dǒng Chéng had some silk to write characters, but did not know what to use as the pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Jí Píng and the others bit their fingers to seal their oath with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them, but couldn't see what they were writing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:43.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1001.363,441.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1500,1940)}Jí Píng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Chancellor! They had ill intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you lie to fulfill your grudge?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare! I wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You said they bit their fingers for an oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Which finger did Jí Píng bite then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The index finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The right index finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I'm telling the truth! Please see for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this medicine so difficult to decoct?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, this medicine shall remove your ailment in one serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Remove my ailment"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you are erudite, therefore must know the etiquette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I think you should know that \Nwhen the lord needs medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}their vassal must taste it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}when the father needs medicine, their son must taste it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You happen to be one of my aides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why did you not taste it first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine is meant for treatment. Why have others taste it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen! This banquet is for you, we end only when drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I invited all the important ministers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:56.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447.727,518.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2140,2460)}Wáng Zǐfú
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How come Dǒng Chéng isn't here? State Uncle Dǒng?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't arrived yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he fell ill recently and couldn't come because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I heard you, Zǐfú, are a heavy drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! I want to have a drinking contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With your prowess, I cannot possibly beat you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you refuse merriment,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to show you an amusement that'd make Zǐfú and the rest of you sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zǐfú, are you sober?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:53.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308.637,418.637)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1860,2220)}Dǒng Chéng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies for being unwelcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, why didn't you come to the banquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still sick, I dared not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a sickness for our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that the State Uncle was ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As such, I bring to you special medicine to treat thine illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This man has incriminated Wáng Zǐfú \Nand four others. They are now imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There is but one person not yet found and arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:08:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jí Píng?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it that ordered you to poison me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Heaven's will to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, he can't take any more beatings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jí Píng, why is your right index finger wounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I bit that finger as oath,\Nto kill the traitor of the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will have your fingers cut off.\NWe'll see if you can make any more oaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have teeth to bite the traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and I still have a tongue to curse that traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut his tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,State Uncle, please tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,where is... the imperial palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish... to see it one last time... Before death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was unable to eliminate the traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus is Heaven's fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Physician!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,State Uncle, perhaps you recognize this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shameless drudge! Lecher! Craven deserter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I should behead you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the first to leak the plot with his testimony. Who dares hurt him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, how could you heed the words of a servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vermin... You would dare?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the Chancellor has-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dǒng Chéng intended to rebel. Was Your Majesty aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dǒng Zhuō is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Dǒng{\i1} Zhuō... {\i0}Dǒng {\i1}Chéng!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We... don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that blood edict?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her out. Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1620,2020)\pos(258.075,477.273)}Emperor \NXiàn of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:14:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Concubine Dǒng is with child of five-months! We beg Chancellor to spare her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And leave a traitorous seed to germinate for vengeance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, take her away! \NIf she refuses to die herself, hang her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I order Cáo Hóng to lead 3,000 soldiers as\Nthe Imperial Guards for the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Henceforth, if any relatives of the Emperor enters the palace without my permission, kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we have Dǒng Chéng and over 700 people under arrest! What shall we do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dǒng Chéng and the others may be dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but Liú Bèi and Mǎ Téng are also included.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They must be removed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Mǎ Téng is guarding Xīliáng, and is not to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We should present him an award to lure him into the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}then eliminate him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:16:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Liú Bèi has only recently raised his troops, there's still unease.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If you were to march east with a regiment, they will be crushed in one battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent! Send out the order to all troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby raise a force of 20,000 to attack Xú Province from five directions...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,... and kill Liú Bèi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fadeth has the winter, cometh has the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone yonder are ice and snow. \NWhat a great time for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Yuán Shào to convey my greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.58,0:17:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to send reinforcments, and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:38.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(322.273,482.727)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything goes wrong, we'll have backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, dividing your troops to guard Xiàpī and Xiǎopèi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,While this forms an ox-horn defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,with the distance between them, if something were to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You needn't say more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, Cáo Cāo is cunning and nefarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With the possibility of a raid in mind, you must be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu, you needn't worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:33.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278.637,492.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2060,2380)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,With Cáo Cāo's attack against Liú Xuándé, Xǔchāng is undefended.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:37.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.455,474.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,450,2020,2340)}Tián Fēng\NStyled: Yuánhào
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We should exploit this by moving our troops in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,in the name of rescuing His Majesty, as well as the masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This would also solve Liú Bèi's crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance. \NPlease, my Lord, make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I too know this is most opportune, \Nyet my heart is very confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising troops might do no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't miss this opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, why say such?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have five sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the youngest one I hold dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want him to die from scabies!\NIf he is about to die, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.78,0:19:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind will be troubled! Troubled so!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will discuss military affairs later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When you return back to Xuándé, explain the matter thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will come to you when I'm feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be easier if Second Brother were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:10.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(289.545,490.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,540,2820,3260)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is coming from afar, so they will be exhausted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.86,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be prepared if you raid their camp!\N Their defeat is guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always regarded you as a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, you managed to capture Liú Dài with clever planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And your tactic now is apt to the art of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I shall leave to make preparations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Select elite troops to raid the camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we will raid the camp together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, Cáo Cāo's attack on Xú Province isn't the same as last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is urgent. Sir, hurry back to Xú Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sūn!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, return to Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There, send someone to hurry over to Xiàpī and inform Yúncháng!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.26,0:22:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is urgent, I will go to Xiàpī myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Yúncháng that the enemy is approaching and that he must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.46,0:23:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the flagpole be broken by wind out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it bode?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.42,0:23:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why halt our march?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A great wind broke the flagpole. \NThe Chancellor asks what it could mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the wind come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,From the south-east!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.74,0:23:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What color was the flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the Chancellor's standard! The flag was red!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.90,0:24:04.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(295,466.363)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,6640,6980)}Guō Jiā\NStyled: Fèngxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.62,0:24:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Liú Bèi will raid us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were my exact thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.02,0:24:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Order all units to standby!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Divide troops into nine! Leave one to build an empty camp! The others shall ambush from all eight sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.22,0:24:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.14,0:24:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heavens smile upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.50,0:24:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.82,0:25:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.62,0:25:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh oh! We fell into that traitor Cáo's plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.86,0:25:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.06,0:25:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.26,0:25:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Guān Yǔ is protecting Liú Bèi's family. He'll die guarding Xiàpī.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.98,0:25:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't obtain him now, I fear Yuán Shào may.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wényuǎn, I have long admired \NYúncháng's prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to have him for my purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.26,0:25:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be better to pressure him into submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng is fiercely loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.46,0:25:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng and I are acquaintances. I will persuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.94,0:26:05.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296.363,466.363)\fade(255,0,255,0,540,1900,2380)}Zhāng Liáo\NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.18,0:26:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.30,0:26:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yúncháng has the strength of ten-thousand men,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.54,0:26:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he can only be swayed with cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.34,0:26:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We should send Liu Bei's surrendered soldiers back to Xiapi and claim that they deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.42,0:26:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Lay ambush within the city, \Nand lure Yúncháng out to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I will feign defeat \Nto lead him somewhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.30,0:26:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}have elite units cut off all escape routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.74,0:26:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Then I will ask for his surrender, and end this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:52.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296.363,466.363)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1420,1780)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.94,0:27:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General, how can the sky be red today?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:27:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the beacon from Xiàpī?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:28:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.46,0:29:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.14,0:29:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.90,0:29:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, do you really want to fight to the death?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.02,0:29:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior without weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.66,0:29:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you plan to mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then let me tell you of last night's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor was already prepared. He had ambushes on all eight sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.90,0:29:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He has this mountain besieged as of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.98,0:29:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, trying to force your way \Nto Xiàpī simply isn't possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.82,0:29:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor Cáo has already broken into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.58,0:30:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please think this over, Yúncháng.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.42,0:30:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wényuǎn, do you intend for me to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.50,0:30:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, you saved me.\N How could I not repay that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.22,0:30:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then will you break me out of this siege?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.46,0:30:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't help me, then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.18,0:30:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.70,0:30:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no news of sir Xuándé's survival, neither that of Sir Yìdé's!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.12,0:30:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This time when Chancellor broke\N into the city, we left citizens unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.50,0:30:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor sent someone to watch over sir Xuándé's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.14,0:31:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all I want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you do wish me to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.26,0:31:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I am at my end, as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.90,0:31:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back whence you came, \Nand we will battle to the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.66,0:31:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,To answer with such, do you wish ridicule upon yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.82,0:31:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I will die with honor! \NWhy would I be ridiculed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.86,0:31:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you die in battle, \Nyou will have committed three sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.06,0:31:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.18,0:31:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Prior, you and sir Liú \Nformed a bond for the greater good,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.34,0:31:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}vowing to share life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.38,0:31:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now with sir Liú's defeat \Nyou wish to fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.46,0:31:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet if your master would return, \Nthere would be no one to aid him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.54,0:31:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Would that not be a betrayal of your oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.46,0:31:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is your first sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.22,0:31:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir Liú has entrusted his family to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If you die now, his wives would be without support!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.70,0:32:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could that not betray his trust in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.10,0:32:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is your second sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.10,0:32:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You abilities are without peer, \Nand your learning vast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.66,0:32:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet you don't consider aiding sir Liú to restore the Hàn Empire, but recklessly tread on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.94,0:32:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}That is a fool's bravery! \NHow is that virtuous?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.58,0:32:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is your third sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.70,0:32:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}These are your three sins. \NI am sorry to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You say there are three sins, \Nthen what do you wish of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.42,0:32:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lord Cáo has us surrounded on all sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If you don't surrender, you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.54,0:32:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To die would be for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.82,0:32:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Better to surrender to Lord Cáo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.86,0:33:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}There, you could wait for news of your master, then return to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.74,0:33:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You would protect the two mistresses,\Nand secondly, you would not betray your oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.14,0:33:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Third, you could exercise aid for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.22,0:33:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With these three reasons, please reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.06,0:33:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}For your three reasons, \NI answer with three terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.26,0:33:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If Lord Cáo is able to heed it, I shall cast off my armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If he won't accept it, I would rather die in battle with my three sins!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.70,0:33:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Chancellor is bounteous. \NHow could he refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.18,0:33:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He will listen to your three conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.06,0:34:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}First, me and the Imperial Uncle made an oath to restore the Hàn Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.14,0:34:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I cede only to the Emperor, not to Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.06,0:34:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Second, my sisters-in-law's residence shall be supported with their husband's imperial salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.06,0:34:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Anyone else, regardless of rank, \Nis not allowed to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.82,0:34:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Third, once I find out \Nthe Imperial Uncle's whereabouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.70,0:34:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}be the distance a thousand or tenfold,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.02,0:34:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will leave sir Cáo to search for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If one of these three is refused, I will never surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.66,0:34:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I expect you, Wényuǎn, to report this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.46,0:35:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He would leave once he finds out where Liú Bèi is?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.18,0:35:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why even bother keeping Guān Yúncháng?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.30,0:35:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you need not worry. Liú Bèi is kind to Yúncháng, but nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.26,0:35:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If Chancellor were to show more favor to Yúncháng, to win him over,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.82,0:35:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,why worry over Yúncháng not staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.54,0:35:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, is it not for Yúncháng's loyalty that you admire him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.98,0:35:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He is an honorable man who will repay his dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.78,0:35:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You are correct, Wényuǎn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.86,0:35:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I accept his three conditions!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.10,0:35:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.70,0:35:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.54,0:36:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All troops surrounding the mountain are to retreat 30 {\i1}lǐ.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.38,0:36:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow Yúncháng to enter the city \Nand meet with two mistresses first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.18,0:36:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.54,0:36:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.94,0:36:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for my absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.94,0:36:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I left the city to fight, \Nbut was besieged at the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.30,0:37:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo sent Zhāng Liáo to persuade my surrender. I accepted for three conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.42,0:37:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I concede to the Hàn Empire, not to Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.98,0:37:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Secondly, he is to support the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.66,0:37:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your residence cannot be entered by others.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.38,0:37:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Third, once I discover my elder brother's whereabouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.70,0:37:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will leave Cáo Cāo to find him, no matter the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.62,0:37:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not ask of your thoughts, please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.26,0:37:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, do you know where the Imperial Uncle is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.90,0:37:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.78,0:37:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, when the Cáo army \Nentered the city, we would've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.94,0:37:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet no one intruded on us,\Nnot one soldier dared to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.82,0:38:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've sealed your agreement, why discuss it with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.62,0:38:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I only fear that in the future, Cáo Cāo won't allow you to search for the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.18,0:38:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, sisters-in-law. \NI made sure to have my say in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, you can make the decisions. \NYou don't need to discuss them with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.94,0:38:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Second Brother, be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.66,0:38:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law, please go inside and rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.42,0:39:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This defeated warrior is grateful\N for the Chancellor's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long admired your loyalty and integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.78,0:39:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To meet with you today is my greatest fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.42,0:39:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Wényuǎn received my three terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:40:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I hope you won't violate your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.02,0:40:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I made my promise.\NHow could I dare violate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.22,0:40:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I know the Imperial Uncle's location,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.50,0:40:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will search for him by hook or by crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.26,0:40:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I might not bid you farewell then. \NPlease accept my discourtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.78,0:40:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send you where Xuándé is, if he were here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.90,0:40:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I only fear he may have already\N died with my army's arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.98,0:40:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, fear not, for I will search everywhere for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.22,0:40:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!

